## Types

Shared types used between layers live in `s3/types.rs`. Never use raw SDK types in command return values — always map to local types.

```rust
// s3/types.rs
use serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};

#[derive(Debug, Serialize, Deserialize, Clone)]
pub struct BucketFile {
    pub key: String,
    pub size: u64,
    pub last_modified: String,
    pub etag: String,
    pub is_folder: bool,
}

#[derive(Debug, Serialize, Deserialize, Clone)]
pub struct UploadProgress {
    pub key: String,
    pub bytes_sent: u64,
    pub total_bytes: u64,
}
```

